From: Security Engineer <security@example.com>
Date: Mon, 01 Jan 2024 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix path traversal in applicationData API

The validateAppId() function only blocked forward slashes, but on Windows
backslashes also act as path separators. Use the platform-independent
path.sep from the 'path' module to block both separators consistently.

Additionally, sanitize all input paths by resolving them and checking
they are within the intended base directory to prevent any other form
of traversal.

