Subject: [PATCH] Fix CVE-2022-29257: Validate all files in update package

Ensure that the update package's integrity is verified by checking a
signed manifest that contains hashes of all files. Previously, only the
signature of the main executable was checked, allowing attackers to
inject malicious code into other components.

